# Replace ORG with your GitHub organization (the installer does it with --org).
# Teams must have write access to the repo. The LAST matching rule wins.
# Default: IT owns everything. For style-only pull requests to merge without IT (the "fast lane"), do NOT turn on
# "Require review from Code Owners" in the ruleset: the path-guard check itself demands an IT approval for everything that is not style-only.

*                       @HopeITs/it-team

# Optional: let department leads approve front-end-only pull requests (either team can approve).
